Relevant columns and how they will be used  
• `stn`: filter on the LaGuardia Airport station number (‑ '725030').  
• `year`: filter / group so that we only pull 2011 – 2020.  
• `mo`: filter on June (‑ '06').  
• `da`: filter on the 12th (‑ '12').  
• `temp`: daily mean temperature – the value we want to display (or average if more than one record exists for that day).  
• `wdsp`: daily mean wind‑speed in knots – the value we want to display (cast to FLOAT64 when we need maths).  
• `prcp`: daily precipitation in inches – the value we want to display.  
• `count_temp`, `count_wdsp`, `flag_prcp` … may be useful for QA but not strictly required for the basic answer.  

Typical conditions  
```
WHERE stn = '725030'
  AND mo = '06'
  AND da = '12'
  AND year BETWEEN '2011' AND '2020'
```

